{
  "slug": "keeperhub",
  "name": "Keeperhub",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build and manage automation workflows from Claude Code. Monitor smart contracts, track on-chain events, configure scheduled tasks, and connect notifications across Discord, Telegram, email, and webhooks. Connects to KeeperHub's remote MCP server with OAuth browser authentication.\nA test API key for review is available on request at support@keeperhub.com. Set KH_API_KEY=<provided key> to authenticate without OAuth.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `execution-monitor` (Monitor and debug KeeperHub workflow executions), `keeperhub-wallet` (KeeperHub agentic wallet — pay for KeeperHub marketplace workflows and any x402 / MPP 402 endpoint), `plugin-explorer` (Explore available KeeperHub plugins and integrations), `template-browser` (Browse and deploy pre-built KeeperHub workflow templates), `workflow-builder` (Help users create KeeperHub workflows from natural language descriptions)\n- **Commands** (2): `login` (Connect to KeeperHub MCP), `status` (Check KeeperHub MCP connection status and authentication)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `keeperhub`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install keeperhub@claude-community` from `KeeperHub/claude-plugins` (`plugins/keeperhub`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
